            "image": "shopify://shop_images/feeling-heavy.webp",
            "image_alt": "Feeling Heavy",
            "text": "<p>When your jeans suddenly feel tighter, the natural reaction is often:</p>",
            "list": "Reduce portions\nCut carbohydrates\nSkip breakfast\nAvoid dessert\nStart another “clean” diet",
