        "rich_text_8qyrYH": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We believe <strong>effective gut support doesn't come from adding more ingredients</strong>. It comes from <strong>choosing the right one.<br/><br/></strong>At Lumway Labs after evaluating different ingredient approaches for everyday digestive support, we built Gut Flow around <strong>clinically studied prebiotic inulin</strong> because it consistently stood out for one simple reason:<br/><br/><strong>Not all fiber works the same.</strong> Most fibers simply add bulk. <strong>Prebiotic inulin does something different. </strong>Instead of simply passing through your digestive system, it <strong>selectively nourishes the beneficial bacteria already living in your gut.<br/><br/></strong>As these bacteria naturally ferment inulin, they produce beneficial compounds that help support:</p>",
